(5055980, 737908, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great image, love the composition and tone. Too many sharpening artifacts for my taste. Still, probably top 10.</td>', 'Great image, love the composition and tone. Too many sharpening artifacts for my taste. Still, probably top 10.', '2008-11-11 00:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055982, 738133, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not an element, though I love the humor. Gonna have to give this one some thought, but you get a neutral 5 from me for the moment.</td>', 'Not an element, though I love the humor. Gonna have to give this one some thought, but you get a neutral 5 from me for the moment.', '2008-11-11 00:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055984, 738254, 83313, '<td valign="top">The DOF seems a bit too shallow to show off all the detail here. Also the background seems to match the subject too closely.</td>', 'The DOF seems a bit too shallow to show off all the detail here. Also the background seems to match the subject too closely.', '2008-11-11 00:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055988, 738238, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, though it does manage to fit the topic. Too much obvious use of neatimage (or similar) for my preference, however.</td>', 'Very pretty, though it does manage to fit the topic. Too much obvious use of neatimage (or similar) for my preference, however.', '2008-11-11 00:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055993, 737826, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit static to me. If i was shooting this one, I would have gotten down really low for a perspective shot.</td>', 'Seems a bit static to me. If i was shooting this one, I would have gotten down really low for a perspective shot.', '2008-11-11 00:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055994, 737618, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and composition, as far as I know, phlogiston is a theory, not an element on the periodic table. 4 because I like it, I just wish you had not called if phlogiston! At least then I could have made something up in my own mind as to what element of the periodic table you are photographing. PM if I''m wrong.</td>', 'Great perspective and composition, as far as I know, phlogiston is a theory, not an element on the periodic table. 4 because I like it, I just wish you had not called if phlogiston! At least then I could have made something up in my own mind as to what element of the periodic table you are photographing. PM if I''m wrong.', '2008-11-11 00:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5055997, 737769, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. CC: I think the focus would have been better placed on the center start. As it is, the right star is in focus, and only half the center star. I''m suggesting this based on your composition and title. Very good lighting.</td>', 'I like the composition. CC: I think the focus would have been better placed on the center start. As it is, the right star is in focus, and only half the center star. I''m suggesting this based on your composition and title. Very good lighting.', '2008-11-11 00:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056002, 737876, 83313, '<td valign="top">Paul ponders the final stumper in the Bayside High School spelling bee. Could he remember how to spell the word for a popular sandwich cookie?<br/> <br/>I expect this one to place high. Don''t disappoint me.</td>', 'Paul ponders the final stumper in the Bayside High School spelling bee. Could he remember how to spell the word for a popular sandwich cookie? I expect this one to place high. Don''t disappoint me.', '2008-11-11 00:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056007, 737775, 83313, '<td valign="top">An incredible amount of detail you''ve managed to fit into his. Certainly one that is not done any justice by the thumbnail. A dumb question from an ignorant person: Why do they put a bug on their coin? I''m sure there must be a good reason. I may need to consult the oracle of Wikipedia on this one.</td>', 'An incredible amount of detail you''ve managed to fit into his. Certainly one that is not done any justice by the thumbnail. A dumb question from an ignorant person: Why do they put a bug on their coin? I''m sure there must be a good reason. I may need to consult the oracle of Wikipedia on this one.', '2008-11-11 00:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056015, 737929, 54645, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I love this. My only question is why does the right third have a touch of motion blur. Love the grain in the mid tones. Nice use of diagonal composition to support the centered composition of your focal point. Some may wonder about the left strip of negative space but I like it, gives more depth.</td>', 'Yeah, I love this. My only question is why does the right third have a touch of motion blur. Love the grain in the mid tones. Nice use of diagonal composition to support the centered composition of your focal point. Some may wonder about the left strip of negative space but I like it, gives more depth.', '2008-11-11 00:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056026, 737857, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not an element ... yet. With Up, Down, Charmed ... maybe in some future, possible, galaxy. Nice image though. I like the pixelated screen.</td>', 'Not an element ... yet. With Up, Down, Charmed ... maybe in some future, possible, galaxy. Nice image though. I like the pixelated screen.', '2008-11-11 00:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056028, 737913, 76430, '<td valign="top">In name only.  Actually graphite.  Nice sharp image and good DOF though.</td>', 'In name only.  Actually graphite.  Nice sharp image and good DOF though.', '2008-11-11 00:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056031, 737779, 83313, '<td valign="top">That''s some very well traveled spices. A little high key for me, the actual subject of the challenge is the hard to make out highlights.</td>', 'That''s some very well traveled spices. A little high key for me, the actual subject of the challenge is the hard to make out highlights.', '2008-11-11 00:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
