(5056378, 737830, 27161, '<td valign="top">I understand your intent to make it look like it is falling, but the viewer needs some frame of reference in the background.  Otherwise it looks like a poorly cropped stock photo of a ring.  <br/> <br/>I''m not sure what your technique is here.  If your ring actually is falling, try to give it some sort of texture or point of reference in the background.  If you can''t pull off a falling object then try hanging it from fishing line.</td>', 'I understand your intent to make it look like it is falling, but the viewer needs some frame of reference in the background.  Otherwise it looks like a poorly cropped stock photo of a ring.   I''m not sure what your technique is here.  If your ring actually is falling, try to give it some sort of texture or point of reference in the background.  If you can''t pull off a falling object then try hanging it from fishing line.', '2008-11-11 08:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
