(5056583, 737858, 66201, '<td valign="top">Creative and well composed - looks like an autumn tree.</td>', 'Creative and well composed - looks like an autumn tree.', '2008-11-11 09:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056588, 737842, 66201, '<td valign="top">Lots of fun - very sweet image and simple yet to the point. Strange how the cut-off faces pull the eye outwards beyond the edges.</td>', 'Lots of fun - very sweet image and simple yet to the point. Strange how the cut-off faces pull the eye outwards beyond the edges.', '2008-11-11 09:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056589, 737922, 66201, '<td valign="top">Fantastic abstract - great composition.</td>', 'Fantastic abstract - great composition.', '2008-11-11 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056594, 736929, 4267, '<td valign="top">Take an interesting, creative photo of ONE of the elements of the periodic table. The atmosphere is made up of multiple elements. lol. does not meet the challenge. nice pic though. not wise to complain in email abouts one''s opinions of your photo, it is my opinion, and I am entitled to it.</td>', 'Take an interesting, creative photo of ONE of the elements of the periodic table. The atmosphere is made up of multiple elements. lol. does not meet the challenge. nice pic though. not wise to complain in email abouts one''s opinions of your photo, it is my opinion, and I am entitled to it.', '2008-11-11 09:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056600, 737787, 66201, '<td valign="top">Looking like either a Tim or Lydia image...great idea and I love the way the blues are so punchy against the autumn colours. Personally the soft focus on the yellowist leaves is distracting and my initial reaction was to blink my eyes back into focus, and then I thought my screen was dodgy, and then I saw that it wasn''t. But now on second looking, the soft focus gives this a dreamlike quality which I rather like.</td>', 'Looking like either a Tim or Lydia image...great idea and I love the way the blues are so punchy against the autumn colours. Personally the soft focus on the yellowist leaves is distracting and my initial reaction was to blink my eyes back into focus, and then I thought my screen was dodgy, and then I saw that it wasn''t. But now on second looking, the soft focus gives this a dreamlike quality which I rather like.', '2008-11-11 09:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056602, 737819, 66201, '<td valign="top">bold bright and blue - a clear direct image.</td>', 'bold bright and blue - a clear direct image.', '2008-11-11 09:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056616, 737921, 97893, '<td valign="top">:-))), Very interesting thought!</td>', ':-))), Very interesting thought!', '2008-11-11 09:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056625, 737876, 97893, '<td valign="top">Love the way this pictur has been conceptualized! <br/>Though I can''t vote, you get my vote of appreciation, 10.<br/> <br/>Surely one of the best pictures that I have seen @DP. Will be eager to see how it fares. Best of Luck!</td>', 'Love the way this pictur has been conceptualized! Though I can''t vote, you get my vote of appreciation, 10. Surely one of the best pictures that I have seen @DP. Will be eager to see how it fares. Best of Luck!', '2008-11-11 10:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056626, 737990, 76598, '<td valign="top">The shadow adds an interesting effect to what might normally be a very dull image, good contrast</td>', 'The shadow adds an interesting effect to what might normally be a very dull image, good contrast', '2008-11-11 10:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
