(5056731, 737858, 54446, '<td valign="top">I really like your creativity... injecting "life" into a common element.  Well done.  Excellent entry.  Should be the winner.   At least it''s my favorite in this challenge.  (10)</td>', 'I really like your creativity... injecting "life" into a common element.  Well done.  Excellent entry.  Should be the winner.   At least it''s my favorite in this challenge.  (10)', '2008-11-11 11:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
