(5056753, 737921, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  A friend of mine who is an Einstein fan has that picture in her office.  Always makes me laugh.</td>', 'LOL!  A friend of mine who is an Einstein fan has that picture in her office.  Always makes me laugh.', '2008-11-11 11:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
