(5056762, 737913, 30982, '<td valign="top">And everyone is probably giving you a hard time because lead in pencils is really graphite, which I think is carbon.  Pretty good macro - I like the shallow DOF.</td>', 'And everyone is probably giving you a hard time because lead in pencils is really graphite, which I think is carbon.  Pretty good macro - I like the shallow DOF.', '2008-11-11 11:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
