(5056765, 737809, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done - good warm tones, nice layout of the pieces.  I can see this in a magazine.</td>', 'Very nicely done - good warm tones, nice layout of the pieces.  I can see this in a magazine.', '2008-11-11 11:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
