(5056775, 737596, 30982, '<td valign="top">Didn''t anyone tell you you aren''t supposed to handle mercury?  It''s not good for you!  Pretty stuff, though.</td>', 'Didn''t anyone tell you you aren''t supposed to handle mercury?  It''s not good for you!  Pretty stuff, though.', '2008-11-11 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
