(5056786, 738225, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  And some bitchin'' whitewalls to go with it, too.</td>', 'Heh!  And some bitchin'' whitewalls to go with it, too.', '2008-11-11 11:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056787, 737855, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hi Janna!  I think this is an excellent shot for the challenge.  Nicely thought out, well laid out, good use of the elements, and a great title for the shot as well.  I like the out of focus diamonds in the foreground, but there are some voters that don''t like anything blurred - can''t please ''em all.  The only techical nits I can find are the sections of too-bright reflection on the three prominent diamonds, particularly the top one.  You''ll have to ask after the challenge, but I think in advanced you could have cloned a bit to reduce that blown out section.  It''s terribly hard to avoid bright spots on diamonds because of the facets - at least one is going to be facing a light source in some way - that''s what makes them sparkle, after all.  The only other thing I can think of is maybe making the background a less dullish color.  Blue or white would be good.  All in all, I think you did a great job with this!</td>', 'Hi Janna!  I think this is an excellent shot for the challenge.  Nicely thought out, well laid out, good use of the elements, and a great title for the shot as well.  I like the out of focus diamonds in the foreground, but there are some voters that don''t like anything blurred - can''t please ''em all.  The only techical nits I can find are the sections of too-bright reflection on the three prominent diamonds, particularly the top one.  You''ll have to ask after the challenge, but I think in advanced you could have cloned a bit to reduce that blown out section.  It''s terribly hard to avoid bright spots on diamonds because of the facets - at least one is going to be facing a light source in some way - that''s what makes them sparkle, after all.  The only other thing I can think of is maybe making the background a less dullish color.  Blue or white would be good.  All in all, I think you did a great job with this!', '2008-11-11 11:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056788, 737906, 30982, '<td valign="top">Commenting only - this is awesome.  Great portrait, great interpretation of the challenge.  Hope this does well.</td>', 'Commenting only - this is awesome.  Great portrait, great interpretation of the challenge.  Hope this does well.', '2008-11-11 11:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056792, 737785, 30982, '<td valign="top">If that really is sulfur, that has to stink!  Really nice shot with the smoke/mist, color.  Good composition.</td>', 'If that really is sulfur, that has to stink!  Really nice shot with the smoke/mist, color.  Good composition.', '2008-11-11 11:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056797, 737618, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, you''re gonna make me go look up Phologiston.... hang on...  Very interesting!  I learned something new today.  Now don''t go torching the service station.  Not good for your health or your ability to live outside of confinement.</td>', 'OK, you''re gonna make me go look up Phologiston.... hang on...  Very interesting!  I learned something new today.  Now don''t go torching the service station.  Not good for your health or your ability to live outside of confinement.', '2008-11-11 11:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
