(5056815, 738225, 76598, '<td valign="top">The composition isn''t striking a note with me.  Something of interest in the reflection might have been very appealing.  The glare off the wheel cover is also a bit distracting.</td>', 'The composition isn''t striking a note with me.  Something of interest in the reflection might have been very appealing.  The glare off the wheel cover is also a bit distracting.', '2008-11-11 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
