(5056828, 738224, 76598, '<td valign="top">I have learned something....I am unsure of the image, it has to be accepted as an abstract and those usually don''t appeal to me.</td>', 'I have learned something....I am unsure of the image, it has to be accepted as an abstract and those usually don''t appeal to me.', '2008-11-11 11:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056830, 738142, 76598, '<td valign="top">what do I say, both appealing and bland at the same time.  Good use of shadowing, I like the dark area, although the image as a whole is rather bland</td>', 'what do I say, both appealing and bland at the same time.  Good use of shadowing, I like the dark area, although the image as a whole is rather bland', '2008-11-11 11:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056831, 737235, 76598, '<td valign="top">You really went to some trouble to get this into the period table.  I hope you didn''t get lead poisoning in the process.  The image is colorful and well exposed, but beyond that you may not score too well :)</td>', 'You really went to some trouble to get this into the period table.  I hope you didn''t get lead poisoning in the process.  The image is colorful and well exposed, but beyond that you may not score too well :)', '2008-11-11 11:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056838, 737876, 76598, '<td valign="top">Not exactly sure how you did this, but I like the image.  It strikes me that his eye is focused on the camera rather than on what he is supposedly writing on.</td>', 'Not exactly sure how you did this, but I like the image.  It strikes me that his eye is focused on the camera rather than on what he is supposedly writing on.', '2008-11-11 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056839, 737932, 76598, '<td valign="top">My mind wants more depth of field and I am distracted by the amount of "useless" unfocused visual information provided.</td>', 'My mind wants more depth of field and I am distracted by the amount of "useless" unfocused visual information provided.', '2008-11-11 11:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5056841, 737774, 76598, '<td valign="top">Too many people followed this and the aluminum theme.  Good color and exposure but the concept doesn''t stand out.</td>', 'Too many people followed this and the aluminum theme.  Good color and exposure but the concept doesn''t stand out.', '2008-11-11 11:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
