(5057766, 737886, 18655, '<td valign="top">An ok image but not very interesting. Would you spend money to frame this and put it on your wall?</td>', 'An ok image but not very interesting. Would you spend money to frame this and put it on your wall?', '2008-11-11 17:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
