(5057774, 737814, 18655, '<td valign="top">This is just bad - sorry. You managed to get a  kind of a copper tone in the overall color pf the picture - which is good. But as  photography I just don''t see any good things.</td>', 'This is just bad - sorry. You managed to get a  kind of a copper tone in the overall color pf the picture - which is good. But as  photography I just don''t see any good things.', '2008-11-11 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
