(5058469, 738039, 83650, '<td valign="top">Just an fyi from a numismatist, it wasn''t 100% silver.  It has a 10% copper content.</td>', 'Just an fyi from a numismatist, it wasn''t 100% silver.  It has a 10% copper content.', '2008-11-12 00:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5058630, 737841, 18655, '<td valign="top">Not very pleasing to my eye but sharp. Too busy and I just don''t see the photographic value in this.<br/>To produce a sharp picture in this day and age is just not too hard with even el-cheapo snap shot cameras with built in IS and 10MP. We (including myself) really have to learn taking pictures that conveys something else than the objects by them selves - as long as their not intended for stock photography of course.</td>', 'Not very pleasing to my eye but sharp. Too busy and I just don''t see the photographic value in this.To produce a sharp picture in this day and age is just not too hard with even el-cheapo snap shot cameras with built in IS and 10MP. We (including myself) really have to learn taking pictures that conveys something else than the objects by them selves - as long as their not intended for stock photography of course.', '2008-11-12 01:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
