(5059494, 737812, 99088, '<td valign="top">Great capture, however you did not photograph a mercury thermometer but rather an alcohol thermometer. When the liquid is red the thermometer is an alcohol thermometer and has a lower temperature range than a mercury thermometer which the liquid inside would then be metallic. <br/> <br/>But like I said before, otherwise great capture</td>', 'Great capture, however you did not photograph a mercury thermometer but rather an alcohol thermometer. When the liquid is red the thermometer is an alcohol thermometer and has a lower temperature range than a mercury thermometer which the liquid inside would then be metallic.  But like I said before, otherwise great capture', '2008-11-12 10:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
