(5059653, 737867, 67723, '<td valign="top">DNMC, H2O is not on the periodic table of elements.  You could argue that Hydrogen and Oxygen both are on the table and comprised they can form H2O but than in my opinion this would just be a shoehorned image, because basically  everything is made up of elements from the periodic table.</td>', 'DNMC, H2O is not on the periodic table of elements.  You could argue that Hydrogen and Oxygen both are on the table and comprised they can form H2O but than in my opinion this would just be a shoehorned image, because basically  everything is made up of elements from the periodic table.', '2008-11-12 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
