(5059953, 737913, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ummm, modern pencil "lead" is actually graphite. Graphite is a form of carbon, which is also an element, so this is not DNMC.  However, it does make your title incorrect.<br/> <br/>Good, though I''ve seen similar shots that managed to squeeze just a little more detail into the subject. Still worth a 6 from me.</td>', 'Ummm, modern pencil "lead" is actually graphite. Graphite is a form of carbon, which is also an element, so this is not DNMC.  However, it does make your title incorrect. Good, though I''ve seen similar shots that managed to squeeze just a little more detail into the subject. Still worth a 6 from me.', '2008-11-12 13:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060216, 737842, 56502, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for zinc (or steel) and a photo - but it''s no surprise they can''t hear anything using it like that ...</td>', 'Nice idea for zinc (or steel) and a photo - but it''s no surprise they can''t hear anything using it like that ...', '2008-11-12 14:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
