(5060256, 737857, 18655, '<td valign="top">All the challenges as I see it has three factors as DPC describes it: the challenge theme itself, the photo should be creative and the photo should be interesting. You may have failed on the challenge part but you scored very well on the most important parts which is to make a nice photo.<br/>It''s exciting, mystic and makes me think who she she is and what she is doing there.<br/>I love it. Even the reflection in the glass of the tree/forest is appropriate but it''s unfortunate that the cars (looks like two) was there. But I guess it they weren''t yours to move or you would''ve done it.<br/> <br/>Well done!!</td>', 'All the challenges as I see it has three factors as DPC describes it: the challenge theme itself, the photo should be creative and the photo should be interesting. You may have failed on the challenge part but you scored very well on the most important parts which is to make a nice photo.It''s exciting, mystic and makes me think who she she is and what she is doing there.I love it. Even the reflection in the glass of the tree/forest is appropriate but it''s unfortunate that the cars (looks like two) was there. But I guess it they weren''t yours to move or you would''ve done it. Well done!!', '2008-11-12 15:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060260, 737849, 18655, '<td valign="top">I do like the blue tones and the mix of straight lines, diagonal and arch. Other than that I don''t find it overly exciting.</td>', 'I do like the blue tones and the mix of straight lines, diagonal and arch. Other than that I don''t find it overly exciting.', '2008-11-12 15:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060267, 737774, 18655, '<td valign="top">There''s been a few balloon pictures. I don''t care to look at them and yours is no different. But you have shown some creativity by leaving some negative space (a good thing) and a crop that I don''t think could get any better. It was also a good idea to leave the knot in the middle.<br/>The red against a black background is good. But otherwise it is really not a good artistic photo.</td>', 'There''s been a few balloon pictures. I don''t care to look at them and yours is no different. But you have shown some creativity by leaving some negative space (a good thing) and a crop that I don''t think could get any better. It was also a good idea to leave the knot in the middle.The red against a black background is good. But otherwise it is really not a good artistic photo.', '2008-11-12 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060272, 737779, 18655, '<td valign="top">This does not represent the periodic elements very well to me (the alt is hardly visible but could be my monitor) and looks very messy.<br/>If you had organized the mess a little better it may have helped.</td>', 'This does not represent the periodic elements very well to me (the alt is hardly visible but could be my monitor) and looks very messy.If you had organized the mess a little better it may have helped.', '2008-11-12 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060275, 737891, 18655, '<td valign="top">I''m very happy that you also did not just snap a picture of the rock but actually did something creative. The model has a great expression for the occasion and lighting is good. Composition is good also.<br/>Clothing, hat and gloves are all appropriate for the setting.</td>', 'I''m very happy that you also did not just snap a picture of the rock but actually did something creative. The model has a great expression for the occasion and lighting is good. Composition is good also.Clothing, hat and gloves are all appropriate for the setting.', '2008-11-12 15:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060277, 737868, 18655, '<td valign="top">What a mess... I understand what you did and it is ok. It also looks good in b/w but it''s just very messy and the milk carton just makes it look there is garbage in the picture.<br/>I know you had to prove the calcium point but if it ruins the picture I would rather leave it out and let the voters figure out for themselves that the cookies are soaked in milk.</td>', 'What a mess... I understand what you did and it is ok. It also looks good in b/w but it''s just very messy and the milk carton just makes it look there is garbage in the picture.I know you had to prove the calcium point but if it ruins the picture I would rather leave it out and let the voters figure out for themselves that the cookies are soaked in milk.', '2008-11-12 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060286, 737572, 18655, '<td valign="top">Is this an ice cube? I can''t really tell. I wish the flame/explosion would have been more in focus. I can''t say I like it but that''s just me :)</td>', 'Is this an ice cube? I can''t really tell. I wish the flame/explosion would have been more in focus. I can''t say I like it but that''s just me :)', '2008-11-12 15:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060298, 737516, 18655, '<td valign="top">Looks good. But other than an appropriate crop and a black background I can''t really see that it is very creative. It''s a picture of an object.<br/> <br/>If this had been a picture of a real black smith hammering away on iron it would obviously have scored much better.<br/> <br/>I realize of course that most of us don''t have black smiths in our neighborhood but I hope you also realize that this image then has to score less.</td>', 'Looks good. But other than an appropriate crop and a black background I can''t really see that it is very creative. It''s a picture of an object. If this had been a picture of a real black smith hammering away on iron it would obviously have scored much better. I realize of course that most of us don''t have black smiths in our neighborhood but I hope you also realize that this image then has to score less.', '2008-11-12 15:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060306, 737855, 18655, '<td valign="top">An ok composition but maybe slightly tight crop. The two ''diamonds'' on the left facing same direction should not have been there as it just makes it look messy.</td>', 'An ok composition but maybe slightly tight crop. The two ''diamonds'' on the left facing same direction should not have been there as it just makes it look messy.', '2008-11-12 15:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060309, 737864, 18655, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this is strontium or not but it doesn''t really matter. It looks interesting and I like the wide format.</td>', 'I can''t tell if this is strontium or not but it doesn''t really matter. It looks interesting and I like the wide format.', '2008-11-12 15:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060313, 737812, 18655, '<td valign="top">It <i>is</i> mercury indeed and it is sharp. But to me this looks more like a stock photo. It does help it a little though that it is an older thermometer and that it is not completely straight.</td>', 'It is mercury indeed and it is sharp. But to me this looks more like a stock photo. It does help it a little though that it is an older thermometer and that it is not completely straight.', '2008-11-12 15:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060318, 737785, 18655, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the title but my English is not that good so could be just me. But it is not a bad capture. Colors and smoke looks good.</td>', 'I don''t understand the title but my English is not that good so could be just me. But it is not a bad capture. Colors and smoke looks good.', '2008-11-12 15:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060321, 737929, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a good result!<br/> <br/>The shallow DOF, b/w and slightly grainy look makes this a nice image to me. The angle which you captured this in addition to the lights in the background makes it even better.<br/>I''m not sure if you put the weeds there yourself but I love it regardless. It would have been a totally different image otherwise.<br/> <br/>Absolutely nothing to deduct from me - 10+</td>', 'Great idea and a good result! The shallow DOF, b/w and slightly grainy look makes this a nice image to me. The angle which you captured this in addition to the lights in the background makes it even better.I''m not sure if you put the weeds there yourself but I love it regardless. It would have been a totally different image otherwise. Absolutely nothing to deduct from me - 10+', '2008-11-12 15:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060323, 737911, 18655, '<td valign="top">Not a super interesting image but you managed to get an ok photo out of a brass chain. Sharpness, shallow DOF and lighting is all good.</td>', 'Not a super interesting image but you managed to get an ok photo out of a brass chain. Sharpness, shallow DOF and lighting is all good.', '2008-11-12 15:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060324, 737523, 18655, '<td valign="top">More coins... I just don''t look at this as an artistic photo with photographic value. The coin is special and lighting is good. But other than that I do not find this interesting.</td>', 'More coins... I just don''t look at this as an artistic photo with photographic value. The coin is special and lighting is good. But other than that I do not find this interesting.', '2008-11-12 15:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060328, 737925, 18655, '<td valign="top">How does this convey the periodic elements? Ok - so it doesn''t really matter too much but the image is just not very good. Out of focus, dark and the pumps looks a little like junk in this particular setting.<br/>I do however like how how you used the tree to frame the picture.</td>', 'How does this convey the periodic elements? Ok - so it doesn''t really matter too much but the image is just not very good. Out of focus, dark and the pumps looks a little like junk in this particular setting.I do however like how how you used the tree to frame the picture.', '2008-11-12 15:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060329, 737873, 18655, '<td valign="top">Another image of a rock... the back lighting looks OK but other than it is just not interesting or pleasing.</td>', 'Another image of a rock... the back lighting looks OK but other than it is just not interesting or pleasing.', '2008-11-12 16:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060336, 737941, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea with a good result. The crop/composition is good and the choice of green ''chlorine'' is also appropriate.<br/>It looks as though there is an alien with a very empty look inside the mask - nice effect!</td>', 'Great idea with a good result. The crop/composition is good and the choice of green ''chlorine'' is also appropriate.It looks as though there is an alien with a very empty look inside the mask - nice effect!', '2008-11-12 16:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060345, 737843, 18655, '<td valign="top">The only things that is in focus here is the ring and it is dead center... Not appealing to me but may be to other. I understand the idea and that you wanted to put focus on the challenge topic but it just doesn''t look very good as is.<br/> <br/>As much as I like the hand (it is a very nice looking hand! :)) I would have maybe opted to put the ring on a branch on the tree and tried to make it interesting. I know - maybe a bad idea but I just don''t like this with the hand in it.</td>', 'The only things that is in focus here is the ring and it is dead center... Not appealing to me but may be to other. I understand the idea and that you wanted to put focus on the challenge topic but it just doesn''t look very good as is. As much as I like the hand (it is a very nice looking hand! :)) I would have maybe opted to put the ring on a branch on the tree and tried to make it interesting. I know - maybe a bad idea but I just don''t like this with the hand in it.', '2008-11-12 16:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060353, 737842, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Technically it is sharp and looks good in b/w. But I also like the entire concept. The cropping with both faces on the outside but enough visible to see that it is a young couple (or at least opposite sex) laves something for the imagination.<br/>I also like how the guy holds the can in a guy manner while the girl is doing in a much more girly way.<br/> <br/>Well thought out!</td>', 'Very nice! Technically it is sharp and looks good in b/w. But I also like the entire concept. The cropping with both faces on the outside but enough visible to see that it is a young couple (or at least opposite sex) laves something for the imagination.I also like how the guy holds the can in a guy manner while the girl is doing in a much more girly way. Well thought out!', '2008-11-12 16:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060355, 737624, 18655, '<td valign="top">The background color is a bad choice. Taking a picture of a camera is another bad choice But any picture is good for practice and I''m pleased to see that you tried to find a creative angle.</td>', 'The background color is a bad choice. Taking a picture of a camera is another bad choice But any picture is good for practice and I''m pleased to see that you tried to find a creative angle.', '2008-11-12 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060367, 738223, 18655, '<td valign="top">A good artistic twist that focuses in the rock. I like the angle and the fading into the white. It was also a smart move to draw the attention away from the dead center of the frame by leaving more of the left side of the band exposed than the right. The minimalistic look is very pleasing to me.<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'A good artistic twist that focuses in the rock. I like the angle and the fading into the white. It was also a smart move to draw the attention away from the dead center of the frame by leaving more of the left side of the band exposed than the right. The minimalistic look is very pleasing to me. Great job!', '2008-11-12 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060456, 737882, 18655, '<td valign="top">A ring doesn''t make the greatest photo but two is better - at least in this case as I feel they could easily tell a story. Father-son, buddies whatever...<br/> <br/>I love the texture on the surface/background and the grainy look. All very appropriate!<br/> <br/>All the details comes out very well with the lighting you provided. At the same time it does not look too sharp. Good use of a shallow DOF.<br/> <br/>In a way so simple but clearly well thought out and a lot of attention to detail. A well deserved 10!</td>', 'A ring doesn''t make the greatest photo but two is better - at least in this case as I feel they could easily tell a story. Father-son, buddies whatever... I love the texture on the surface/background and the grainy look. All very appropriate! All the details comes out very well with the lighting you provided. At the same time it does not look too sharp. Good use of a shallow DOF. In a way so simple but clearly well thought out and a lot of attention to detail. A well deserved 10!', '2008-11-12 16:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060469, 737596, 18655, '<td valign="top">I''m very happy you used two mercury drops and not just one. Makes a world of a difference to my eyes.<br/> <br/>I love the minimalistic look and quality. The reflection in the surface in addition to the flare adds to it. The white does not look perfectly white to me. This is (at least to me) more difficult to achieve and looks so much better! It kind of looks like a pearl finish.<br/> <br/>Overall a great picture that deserves a 10!</td>', 'I''m very happy you used two mercury drops and not just one. Makes a world of a difference to my eyes. I love the minimalistic look and quality. The reflection in the surface in addition to the flare adds to it. The white does not look perfectly white to me. This is (at least to me) more difficult to achieve and looks so much better! It kind of looks like a pearl finish. Overall a great picture that deserves a 10!', '2008-11-12 16:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060472, 737875, 18655, '<td valign="top">Interesting image with exciting lighting. I wish the shades had been a little softer but otherwise looks good.</td>', 'Interesting image with exciting lighting. I wish the shades had been a little softer but otherwise looks good.', '2008-11-12 16:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060475, 737784, 18655, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt to make a picture of a vitamin pill look interesting. Technically it is sharp, good lighting and all but is just not an attractive photo to me.</td>', 'Nice attempt to make a picture of a vitamin pill look interesting. Technically it is sharp, good lighting and all but is just not an attractive photo to me.', '2008-11-12 16:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060478, 737782, 18655, '<td valign="top">Another photo of a rock... You achieved a nice light cast on this but it is still just a rock and does not make for a very interesting shot with any amount of photographic value.</td>', 'Another photo of a rock... You achieved a nice light cast on this but it is still just a rock and does not make for a very interesting shot with any amount of photographic value.', '2008-11-12 16:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060485, 737235, 18655, '<td valign="top">Seems over sharpened to me (but could be my monitor) and although an interesting idea not a very pleasing image.<br/> <br/>The yellow flower in the background should have been removed prior to the shot.</td>', 'Seems over sharpened to me (but could be my monitor) and although an interesting idea not a very pleasing image. The yellow flower in the background should have been removed prior to the shot.', '2008-11-12 16:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060493, 737908, 18655, '<td valign="top">So very true! Great texture on the hands and a nice composition. The shallow DOF looks good to me.<br/> <br/>But I really wish that the finger sticking out under the thumb, towards the bottom of the picture wasn''t there. It kind of sticks out like sore thumb - although it''s not a thumb :)</td>', 'So very true! Great texture on the hands and a nice composition. The shallow DOF looks good to me. But I really wish that the finger sticking out under the thumb, towards the bottom of the picture wasn''t there. It kind of sticks out like sore thumb - although it''s not a thumb :)', '2008-11-12 17:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060499, 737769, 18655, '<td valign="top">Good attempt but I don''t care about the composition. I would have opted to lay one flat on a table with one laying on top of it but on the side as if they had been casually left on the table.<br/>This ''line-up'' seem unnatural to me.</td>', 'Good attempt but I don''t care about the composition. I would have opted to lay one flat on a table with one laying on top of it but on the side as if they had been casually left on the table.This ''line-up'' seem unnatural to me.', '2008-11-12 17:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060508, 737867, 18655, '<td valign="top">No doubt a beautiful image. I love the colors, sharpness but soft at the same time and flood effect. All in all very good but I really wish you had straightened it.<br/> <br/>Whenever there is a horizon on a picture and if you do not intend to do a crazy look it should be absolutely straight. I know that is only slightly off but it does make me want to tilt my head when I look at it.<br/> <br/>Just like a photo on a wall; if it''s just a little crooked, it sticks out like a sore thumb. And it is so ridiculously easy to straighten it so there is really no excuse. Still a 7 from me on this</td>', 'No doubt a beautiful image. I love the colors, sharpness but soft at the same time and flood effect. All in all very good but I really wish you had straightened it. Whenever there is a horizon on a picture and if you do not intend to do a crazy look it should be absolutely straight. I know that is only slightly off but it does make me want to tilt my head when I look at it. Just like a photo on a wall; if it''s just a little crooked, it sticks out like a sore thumb. And it is so ridiculously easy to straighten it so there is really no excuse. Still a 7 from me on this', '2008-11-12 17:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060509, 737914, 98171, '<td valign="top">hey, you had one of the more original ideas in this challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'hey, you had one of the more original ideas in this challenge. Nice job.', '2008-11-12 17:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060513, 737843, 98171, '<td valign="top">I thought this was kind of a cool, abstract way of looking at carbon. I like your originality.</td>', 'I thought this was kind of a cool, abstract way of looking at carbon. I like your originality.', '2008-11-12 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060514, 737775, 18655, '<td valign="top">Not another coin... I''m sorry but I just don''t see anything creative or technical good with this other than it is clear, sharp and you cropped it so that it is not dead in the center.<br/>It''s just not a very interesting image in my eyes.</td>', 'Not another coin... I''m sorry but I just don''t see anything creative or technical good with this other than it is clear, sharp and you cropped it so that it is not dead in the center.It''s just not a very interesting image in my eyes.', '2008-11-12 17:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5060516, 737375, 52500, '<td valign="top">It just doesn''t get any better than an awesome picture coupled with an awesome pun in the title. 10</td>', 'It just doesn''t get any better than an awesome picture coupled with an awesome pun in the title. 10', '2008-11-12 17:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
