(5061103, 737820, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find it very interesting that an antique buggy would be allowed to fall apart in the open like this. the photo could probably benefit from a little sharpening and if there was a perspective without that eye-drawing building in the background, that may have helped as well. I hope you have some more info on how this got here and why.</td>', 'I find it very interesting that an antique buggy would be allowed to fall apart in the open like this. the photo could probably benefit from a little sharpening and if there was a perspective without that eye-drawing building in the background, that may have helped as well. I hope you have some more info on how this got here and why.', '2008-11-12 23:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061109, 737914, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why I didn''t think of neon. Maybe it was just so obvious and always in my face, that I just missed it.<br/> <br/>Excellent composition of this and interesting all around.</td>', 'I don''t know why I didn''t think of neon. Maybe it was just so obvious and always in my face, that I just missed it. Excellent composition of this and interesting all around.', '2008-11-12 23:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061112, 737829, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good stuff here. May have had some more of that DPC-friendly wow factor if you''d bumped up the reds a little more. Like the fact that you caught the sun on the spiderwebs.</td>', 'Good stuff here. May have had some more of that DPC-friendly wow factor if you''d bumped up the reds a little more. Like the fact that you caught the sun on the spiderwebs.', '2008-11-12 23:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061116, 737791, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find my eye exploring all the curves in this one. Well done and a fave. Also, kudos for not taking the saturation to excessive levels.</td>', 'I find my eye exploring all the curves in this one. Well done and a fave. Also, kudos for not taking the saturation to excessive levels.', '2008-11-12 23:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061126, 737844, 83313, '<td valign="top">A neat looking play of light and shadows. It seemed a little soft to me so I looked at the image properties. Your file size of only 124k indicates a moderately compressed image and that could be robbing some detail and sharpness from this image. You had some more overhead on the file size. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'A neat looking play of light and shadows. It seemed a little soft to me so I looked at the image properties. Your file size of only 124k indicates a moderately compressed image and that could be robbing some detail and sharpness from this image. You had some more overhead on the file size. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2008-11-12 23:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061131, 737964, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting on this is a overly bright, even and gives a flat appearance. Perhaps some side lighting would have shown off the wonderful crusty details of this a little better.</td>', 'I think the lighting on this is a overly bright, even and gives a flat appearance. Perhaps some side lighting would have shown off the wonderful crusty details of this a little better.', '2008-11-12 23:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
