(5061592, 737787, 18655, '<td valign="top">Does not look very real to me but makes a great looking image. Love the colors and how you reworked it.</td>', 'Does not look very real to me but makes a great looking image. Love the colors and how you reworked it.', '2008-11-13 04:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5061593, 738160, 18655, '<td valign="top">Finally a picture in this challenge with photographic value. The dark look, graffiti and lighting is good. The model with tattos and all was a good choice for this picture.</td>', 'Finally a picture in this challenge with photographic value. The dark look, graffiti and lighting is good. The model with tattos and all was a good choice for this picture.', '2008-11-13 04:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
