(5061643, 736929, 79816, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I see more nitrogen in this shot than oxygen. Nice sunset, I think this would be more powerful without the dark rocks on the left.</td>', 'Hmm, I see more nitrogen in this shot than oxygen. Nice sunset, I think this would be more powerful without the dark rocks on the left.', '2008-11-13 06:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
