(5061916, 736929, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning lighting. I like the dark and light side, also. I''m glad you didn''t crop the dark element. Nice shot.</td>', 'Stunning lighting. I like the dark and light side, also. I''m glad you didn''t crop the dark element. Nice shot.', '2008-11-13 11:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
