(5061993, 737876, 30214, '<td valign="top">fantastic portrait, I love it. One thing I am kind of wondering about is why he is writing "backwards". I understand it is to help us see what he is writing, but it feels a little bit contrived. Anyway, great work!</td>', 'fantastic portrait, I love it. One thing I am kind of wondering about is why he is writing "backwards". I understand it is to help us see what he is writing, but it feels a little bit contrived. Anyway, great work!', '2008-11-13 12:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
