(5062034, 737752, 4267, '<td valign="top">the liberals will probably rail ya, but I like it, especially with the blurred rifle in the background. nice touch.<br/> <br/>is that a Sharps rifle? .45-110 Cal? or some such?<br/> <br/>well the rounds like narrower than a .45... maybe? hmmm. hard to judge size from the pic.<br/> <br/>nice job.</td>', 'the liberals will probably rail ya, but I like it, especially with the blurred rifle in the background. nice touch. is that a Sharps rifle? .45-110 Cal? or some such? well the rounds like narrower than a .45... maybe? hmmm. hard to judge size from the pic. nice job.', '2008-11-13 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
