(5062321, 737812, 83785, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, great detail, but the thermometer is full of alcohol and not mercury... but, yes I''ll say that thermometers do normally make me think of mercury. Actually choosing an alcohol thermometer makes the picture a lot more interesting with the striking colour, so I like it, well done.</td>', 'Nice picture, great detail, but the thermometer is full of alcohol and not mercury... but, yes I''ll say that thermometers do normally make me think of mercury. Actually choosing an alcohol thermometer makes the picture a lot more interesting with the striking colour, so I like it, well done.', '2008-11-13 15:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5062323, 737882, 811, '<td valign="top">i still really like the background in this.  bet whoever owns the rings makes a really cool couple!</td>', 'i still really like the background in this.  bet whoever owns the rings makes a really cool couple!', '2008-11-13 15:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5062324, 737862, 83785, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but it makes be think of either sugar, salt, or snow. Obvious its a Na element picture, but just doesn''t sound it out to me. In my opinion choosing salt is difficult to communicate one of its two elements, but you did a good effort and i''m sure it was a nice subject to photograph.</td>', 'I like the picture, but it makes be think of either sugar, salt, or snow. Obvious its a Na element picture, but just doesn''t sound it out to me. In my opinion choosing salt is difficult to communicate one of its two elements, but you did a good effort and i''m sure it was a nice subject to photograph.', '2008-11-13 15:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5062326, 737849, 83785, '<td valign="top">I didn''t enter the challenge because I couldn''t find a clear tungsten bulb with the old style W shaped filaments, so for me its nice to see an alternative take on the W element, lovely idea and picture</td>', 'I didn''t enter the challenge because I couldn''t find a clear tungsten bulb with the old style W shaped filaments, so for me its nice to see an alternative take on the W element, lovely idea and picture', '2008-11-13 15:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
