(5063105, 737941, 30490, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what color if any chlorine gas would be, but this image was so creatively executed, I just had to rate it highly.  Is that a dog in the mask?  Great job, This just worked for me on so many levels, and captured the essence of an "gas element" very well.</td>', 'I have no idea what color if any chlorine gas would be, but this image was so creatively executed, I just had to rate it highly.  Is that a dog in the mask?  Great job, This just worked for me on so many levels, and captured the essence of an "gas element" very well.', '2008-11-14 02:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5063107, 737821, 30490, '<td valign="top">Really cute idea.  I''ll bet this was a challenge to shoot!  I''m not sure if I am crazy about the white background and wonder what it would have looked like with a less stark background. The colors seem a bit dull but that could also be my monitor. All in all an excellent image and I rated it very high!</td>', 'Really cute idea.  I''ll bet this was a challenge to shoot!  I''m not sure if I am crazy about the white background and wonder what it would have looked like with a less stark background. The colors seem a bit dull but that could also be my monitor. All in all an excellent image and I rated it very high!', '2008-11-14 02:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
