(5063129, 737812, 89940, '<td valign="top">Technically this is not a Mercury based thermometer. I''m not going to mark down for that though. I like the processing on this and I''m not usually a fan of vignetting but it really works well here.</td>', 'Technically this is not a Mercury based thermometer. I''m not going to mark down for that though. I like the processing on this and I''m not usually a fan of vignetting but it really works well here.', '2008-11-14 03:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5063164, 737855, 89341, '<td valign="top">Ok, here''s my cc :)<br/> <br/>The contrast of the black coal against the shiny sparkly diamonds is great. There are a couple of things that bother me a little, the grey background is a little, well, grey! Maybe a crisp white background may have worked a little better. <br/> <br/>The oof diamonds at the bottom left draw my eye a bit, though I am not a big fan of foreground bokeh, personally I''d have probably left them out of the shot. I <b>do</b> really like the angle they are at though so maybe just a larger dof (though I guess you used the macro tube) to keep them sharper and maybe not cutting any of the diamond off.</td>', 'Ok, here''s my cc :) The contrast of the black coal against the shiny sparkly diamonds is great. There are a couple of things that bother me a little, the grey background is a little, well, grey! Maybe a crisp white background may have worked a little better.  The oof diamonds at the bottom left draw my eye a bit, though I am not a big fan of foreground bokeh, personally I''d have probably left them out of the shot. I do really like the angle they are at though so maybe just a larger dof (though I guess you used the macro tube) to keep them sharper and maybe not cutting any of the diamond off.', '2008-11-14 05:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5063587, 737784, 88136, '<td valign="top">cool idea! focus doesn''t seem to be on the pill though</td>', 'cool idea! focus doesn''t seem to be on the pill though', '2008-11-14 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
