(5064918, 737776, 67697, '<td valign="top">oh my - arsenic and old lace? clever!  the only think i do not get is the cell phone.  was that the only way you could include the arsenic?  very crafty and i am guessing not too many have put together this puzzle.  creative!</td>', 'oh my - arsenic and old lace? clever!  the only think i do not get is the cell phone.  was that the only way you could include the arsenic?  very crafty and i am guessing not too many have put together this puzzle.  creative!', '2008-11-15 10:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5064972, 737235, 54645, '<td valign="top">Clever. I like the concept, very funny.  I have a feeling that the stem and yellow (?flower) in background could have been left out. Too distracting. Also, for my taste it is over sharpened in certain regions. Halo/outlines are quite prominent. I''m still giving it a 5 for the concept. Now go catch a fish!</td>', 'Clever. I like the concept, very funny.  I have a feeling that the stem and yellow (?flower) in background could have been left out. Too distracting. Also, for my taste it is over sharpened in certain regions. Halo/outlines are quite prominent. I''m still giving it a 5 for the concept. Now go catch a fish!', '2008-11-15 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5064977, 737666, 99088, '<td valign="top">I like how this capture meets the challenge. There are iron filing trees, but it doesn''t stop there, there is also iron oxide grass (rust). So it is truly an iron forest. Good Work!</td>', 'I like how this capture meets the challenge. There are iron filing trees, but it doesn''t stop there, there is also iron oxide grass (rust). So it is truly an iron forest. Good Work!', '2008-11-15 11:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5064979, 737596, 99088, '<td valign="top">So simple, yet so nice. Good work</td>', 'So simple, yet so nice. Good work', '2008-11-15 11:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
