(5065588, 737815, 33552, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant, pure, innocent (or is it). The familiar subject is dragged kicking and screaming to a dangerous new level by dark brooding colors and a bold, even violent, composition. ;)</td>', 'Simple, elegant, pure, innocent (or is it). The familiar subject is dragged kicking and screaming to a dangerous new level by dark brooding colors and a bold, even violent, composition. ;)', '2008-11-15 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065590, 737886, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice background and reflections, but the shallow Dof and over-sharpening hurt this image.</td>', 'Nice background and reflections, but the shallow Dof and over-sharpening hurt this image.', '2008-11-15 19:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065597, 737858, 33552, '<td valign="top">An exciting take on the classic man vs. nature conflict! A potentially ominous subject turned joyful celebration, as the bright metallic form reaches triumphantly into the sky.</td>', 'An exciting take on the classic man vs. nature conflict! A potentially ominous subject turned joyful celebration, as the bright metallic form reaches triumphantly into the sky.', '2008-11-15 19:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065602, 737814, 33552, '<td valign="top">Ok, upon first glance, my immediate reaction was oh, no ... not another over-contrived shot. But then I looked again. I absolutely love the lighting in this shot! The arrangement is pleasing, in a geometrical sense, but the straight bits (nails?) add little in my opinion. The background has the perfect color and texure for this shot. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'Ok, upon first glance, my immediate reaction was oh, no ... not another over-contrived shot. But then I looked again. I absolutely love the lighting in this shot! The arrangement is pleasing, in a geometrical sense, but the straight bits (nails?) add little in my opinion. The background has the perfect color and texure for this shot. Well done and good luck.', '2008-11-15 19:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065603, 737857, 51747, '<td valign="top">I hate to admit it, but I don''t get this. Surprisium could be an element, but I don''t get how the image goes with that.</td>', 'I hate to admit it, but I don''t get this. Surprisium could be an element, but I don''t get how the image goes with that.', '2008-11-15 19:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065612, 737809, 33552, '<td valign="top">This is a very well executed shot. I can''t really find any technical faults, however, it just doesn''t grab me in any sort of emotional way. I get it, it just doesn''t move me. I wish I could offer more.</td>', 'This is a very well executed shot. I can''t really find any technical faults, however, it just doesn''t grab me in any sort of emotional way. I get it, it just doesn''t move me. I wish I could offer more.', '2008-11-15 19:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065622, 737819, 33552, '<td valign="top">Thank you for not making me grab my periodic table for the 30th time! I should know it by heart by now :) Excellent shot! Technically perfect, great concept, wonderful color. The only nit pick would be the shadow on the lower left. Great job!</td>', 'Thank you for not making me grab my periodic table for the 30th time! I should know it by heart by now :) Excellent shot! Technically perfect, great concept, wonderful color. The only nit pick would be the shadow on the lower left. Great job!', '2008-11-15 19:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065631, 736675, 33552, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how to critique astrophotography. It''s like trying to find fault with the universe itself, a futile endeavor indeed. As an abstract, however... The centered composition with so much negative space diminishes the impact of the central subject. It almost feels too clinical, too sterile. A closer crop, or off center comp, would do a lot here.</td>', 'I have no idea how to critique astrophotography. It''s like trying to find fault with the universe itself, a futile endeavor indeed. As an abstract, however... The centered composition with so much negative space diminishes the impact of the central subject. It almost feels too clinical, too sterile. A closer crop, or off center comp, would do a lot here.', '2008-11-15 20:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065634, 737873, 33552, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I get the reference in the title. The texture is interesting, but the image fails to inspire any emotional response. Technically, I can''t find fault except perhaps an ever so slightly too narrow DoF, but that''s just nit-picking.</td>', 'I''m not sure I get the reference in the title. The texture is interesting, but the image fails to inspire any emotional response. Technically, I can''t find fault except perhaps an ever so slightly too narrow DoF, but that''s just nit-picking.', '2008-11-15 20:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065635, 738130, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice texture! Perhaps a bit to wide a view, I''d like to be able to see more detail.</td>', 'Nice texture! Perhaps a bit to wide a view, I''d like to be able to see more detail.', '2008-11-15 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065643, 737516, 33552, '<td valign="top">Interesting sculpture. The lighting certainly brings out texture.</td>', 'Interesting sculpture. The lighting certainly brings out texture.', '2008-11-15 20:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065656, 737785, 33552, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting photo, but to be honest, I can''t really tell what''s going on. I would expect to see this with a caption, but it <i>is </i>intriguing.</td>', 'This is a really interesting photo, but to be honest, I can''t really tell what''s going on. I would expect to see this with a caption, but it is intriguing.', '2008-11-15 20:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065658, 737865, 33552, '<td valign="top">I love the texture in the glass and the overall composition.</td>', 'I love the texture in the glass and the overall composition.', '2008-11-15 20:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065660, 737826, 33552, '<td valign="top">Aluminum is nice and all, but I''m not sure it gets me <i>that</i> excited. I like the muted colors in this shot. Tone mapped?</td>', 'Aluminum is nice and all, but I''m not sure it gets me that excited. I like the muted colors in this shot. Tone mapped?', '2008-11-15 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065668, 737769, 33552, '<td valign="top">I had to do a little research when I saw this. A beautiful, symbolic, and historic image. Well composed. One technical note, the focus seems just a tiny bit off here, it pulls the eye too far to the left.</td>', 'I had to do a little research when I saw this. A beautiful, symbolic, and historic image. Well composed. One technical note, the focus seems just a tiny bit off here, it pulls the eye too far to the left.', '2008-11-15 20:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065670, 737975, 33552, '<td valign="top">With a faster shutter speed you may be able to avoid the motion blur on the  bottom  flower. Or you could use a stake and twist-tie if it''s windy.</td>', 'With a faster shutter speed you may be able to avoid the motion blur on the  bottom  flower. Or you could use a stake and twist-tie if it''s windy.', '2008-11-15 20:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065672, 737990, 33552, '<td valign="top">Go on, crop in! Let the lines fill the frame! The border on top of the white border just shrinks the subject here too much. The square crop works with this shot, but it''s just too loose.</td>', 'Go on, crop in! Let the lines fill the frame! The border on top of the white border just shrinks the subject here too much. The square crop works with this shot, but it''s just too loose.', '2008-11-15 20:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065674, 737911, 33552, '<td valign="top">Too many divergent leading lines. My eyes keep darting left and right, up and down. Nice concept, but the composition needs to be cleaned up a bit.</td>', 'Too many divergent leading lines. My eyes keep darting left and right, up and down. Nice concept, but the composition needs to be cleaned up a bit.', '2008-11-15 20:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065676, 737791, 33552, '<td valign="top">If that were coming out of an eye it would score an 11! The concept is ok, and the red light leads nicely into the background, but there is really no emotional impact, or message for that matter.</td>', 'If that were coming out of an eye it would score an 11! The concept is ok, and the red light leads nicely into the background, but there is really no emotional impact, or message for that matter.', '2008-11-15 20:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065681, 737913, 33552, '<td valign="top">I know a pencil should be sharp, but... <br/> <br/>Nice comp and concept. The BG is a bit dingy-white, that should be a quick levels fix, and ease up a bit on the sharpening. Again, nice concept, but take your time with the processing. There is real potential here.</td>', 'I know a pencil should be sharp, but...  Nice comp and concept. The BG is a bit dingy-white, that should be a quick levels fix, and ease up a bit on the sharpening. Again, nice concept, but take your time with the processing. There is real potential here.', '2008-11-15 20:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065683, 737624, 33552, '<td valign="top">Who can? Especially these days. Anyway, nice perspective, but I''m guessing this is more about bragging than anything else. A bit of a voyeuristic angle don''t you think?</td>', 'Who can? Especially these days. Anyway, nice perspective, but I''m guessing this is more about bragging than anything else. A bit of a voyeuristic angle don''t you think?', '2008-11-15 20:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065684, 737919, 33552, '<td valign="top">Does that mean I have to be your bodyguard? And no, you can''t call me Betty.</td>', 'Does that mean I have to be your bodyguard? And no, you can''t call me Betty.', '2008-11-15 20:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065689, 737857, 33552, '<td valign="top">Ok, that''s just creepy. I hope you live in a <i>really</i> bad neighborhood (not really) to justify that! It''ll sure take care of any prospective burglars or vandals though.</td>', 'Ok, that''s just creepy. I hope you live in a really bad neighborhood (not really) to justify that! It''ll sure take care of any prospective burglars or vandals though.', '2008-11-15 21:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065691, 737927, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice layered composition. Watch those reflections though.</td>', 'Nice layered composition. Watch those reflections though.', '2008-11-15 21:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065694, 737921, 33552, '<td valign="top">LOL, love it! I can''t say anything worthwhile, so...<br/> <br/>"Imagination is more important than knowledge."</td>', 'LOL, love it! I can''t say anything worthwhile, so... "Imagination is more important than knowledge."', '2008-11-15 21:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065695, 737964, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but a bit clinical. Take it a step further and add some context.</td>', 'Nice shot, but a bit clinical. Take it a step further and add some context.', '2008-11-15 21:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065697, 737666, 33552, '<td valign="top">This has amazed me since I was a kid (which I never was, I didn''t say that and you cant prove it, I''ll never confess...) Ahem... great shot, it reminds me of the PC lens arial landscapes that look like models. Great title too.</td>', 'This has amazed me since I was a kid (which I never was, I didn''t say that and you cant prove it, I''ll never confess...) Ahem... great shot, it reminds me of the PC lens arial landscapes that look like models. Great title too.', '2008-11-15 21:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065701, 737844, 33552, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s going on with the background, but I like this shot. It''s gritty, I approve.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s going on with the background, but I like this shot. It''s gritty, I approve.', '2008-11-15 21:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065704, 737596, 33552, '<td valign="top">Oooooooooh shiny. Ya'' just gotta'' either use the reflections(to add context) or eliminate them(light tent).</td>', 'Oooooooooh shiny. Ya'' just gotta'' either use the reflections(to add context) or eliminate them(light tent).', '2008-11-15 21:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065707, 737932, 33552, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but the perspective and framing hurt this shot. I feel like she just knocked me over, and now she''s walking away without a second glance! IMO, A horizontal comp with her entering the frame would have been stronger.</td>', 'Good concept, but the perspective and framing hurt this shot. I feel like she just knocked me over, and now she''s walking away without a second glance! IMO, A horizontal comp with her entering the frame would have been stronger.', '2008-11-15 21:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065710, 737505, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice, I''m not sure what it is, but it gives an impression of strength. It''s reminiscent of a safe or something solid and impenetrable, yet intricate and obviously man-made.</td>', 'Nice, I''m not sure what it is, but it gives an impression of strength. It''s reminiscent of a safe or something solid and impenetrable, yet intricate and obviously man-made.', '2008-11-15 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065711, 737908, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice title. It suits this gritty depiction of an often glorified gem. Well composed, well executed and thought provoking.</td>', 'Nice title. It suits this gritty depiction of an often glorified gem. Well composed, well executed and thought provoking.', '2008-11-15 21:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065714, 738238, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, comp, and expression, but overprocessed, IMO. Seems like too much noise reduction, producing stepped gradients around the cheeks and chin, and artifacting around the eyes.</td>', 'Nice concept, comp, and expression, but overprocessed, IMO. Seems like too much noise reduction, producing stepped gradients around the cheeks and chin, and artifacting around the eyes.', '2008-11-15 21:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065720, 737644, 33552, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of negative space here that just isn''t adding anything. Don''t be afraid to fill the frame with your subject.</td>', 'There''s a lot of negative space here that just isn''t adding anything. Don''t be afraid to fill the frame with your subject.', '2008-11-15 21:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065733, 737864, 33552, '<td valign="top">Explosive photo! I like pyro! Come on, who doesn''t? Well done ... what else can I say?<br/> <br/>Oh, I had to come back to add that I am a huge sucker for wide format images.</td>', 'Explosive photo! I like pyro! Come on, who doesn''t? Well done ... what else can I say? Oh, I had to come back to add that I am a huge sucker for wide format images.', '2008-11-15 21:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065756, 737618, 33552, '<td valign="top">Ok, this made me cringe. As a former overnight "On the Run" employee, my biggest fear wasn''t a robbery, it was a fire at the pumps, having witnessed, as a child, first-hand, the explosive "dephlogistication" of another fuel product, <i>en masse</i>. Anyway, I guess it''s well composed and technically well done. I certainly can''t claim that it failed to elicit an emotional response. Well done ... I guess.</td>', 'Ok, this made me cringe. As a former overnight "On the Run" employee, my biggest fear wasn''t a robbery, it was a fire at the pumps, having witnessed, as a child, first-hand, the explosive "dephlogistication" of another fuel product, en masse. Anyway, I guess it''s well composed and technically well done. I certainly can''t claim that it failed to elicit an emotional response. Well done ... I guess.', '2008-11-15 21:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065779, 737929, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. The shallow DoF isolates a clear and well placed focal point, the slightly warm monochrome adds a nostalgic feel and the repeating pattern creates a sense of motion. Well done.</td>', 'I like this shot. The shallow DoF isolates a clear and well placed focal point, the slightly warm monochrome adds a nostalgic feel and the repeating pattern creates a sense of motion. Well done.', '2008-11-15 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065787, 737876, 33552, '<td valign="top">This is very well executed, it''s awful hard to write backwards;) Other than the point of the pencil, however, there is little that screams Tungsten, so, while I question the choice of title, that has little (if any) effect on scoring. Nice shot!</td>', 'This is very well executed, it''s awful hard to write backwards;) Other than the point of the pencil, however, there is little that screams Tungsten, so, while I question the choice of title, that has little (if any) effect on scoring. Nice shot!', '2008-11-15 21:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065803, 737765, 33552, '<td valign="top">Pastels, soft-focus, extremely tilted perspective... I missed the 60''s but that''s about how I picture them. OTOH, it could be an innocent childhood memory of baloons at a birthday party, a bit fuzzy with a touch of gender ambiguity. Ok, I know I try to read too much into a photo, but why else would I be here? Can I just suggest slightly dodging the left side to prevent the background from drawing too much attention.</td>', 'Pastels, soft-focus, extremely tilted perspective... I missed the 60''s but that''s about how I picture them. OTOH, it could be an innocent childhood memory of baloons at a birthday party, a bit fuzzy with a touch of gender ambiguity. Ok, I know I try to read too much into a photo, but why else would I be here? Can I just suggest slightly dodging the left side to prevent the background from drawing too much attention.', '2008-11-15 21:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065819, 737782, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, but try for a bit more DoF on this type of shot.</td>', 'Nice texture, but try for a bit more DoF on this type of shot.', '2008-11-15 21:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065837, 737784, 33552, '<td valign="top">Wow! Serve me a vitamin like that and you''ll never get a complaint! Aside from the frighteningly over-complicated presentation of a recommended daily nutritional suppliment, this is a good shot. Perhaps a bit hot on the upper-left, and a bit yellow on the lower-right. Well done.</td>', 'Wow! Serve me a vitamin like that and you''ll never get a complaint! Aside from the frighteningly over-complicated presentation of a recommended daily nutritional suppliment, this is a good shot. Perhaps a bit hot on the upper-left, and a bit yellow on the lower-right. Well done.', '2008-11-15 22:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065844, 737671, 33552, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, and a nice demonstration. May I suggest tightening up the crop a bit to lose a bit of the bottom and keep attention on the subjects. Great job at focusing through curved glass!</td>', 'Cool shot, and a nice demonstration. May I suggest tightening up the crop a bit to lose a bit of the bottom and keep attention on the subjects. Great job at focusing through curved glass!', '2008-11-15 22:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065847, 737899, 33552, '<td valign="top">Cool! The uneven background throws this off a bit, but it''s a great texture and pattern shot.</td>', 'Cool! The uneven background throws this off a bit, but it''s a great texture and pattern shot.', '2008-11-15 22:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065851, 737812, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic lighting and composition, but 80? It''s a bit of an anti-climax. Mid-teens or 120 plus would be more appropriate, unless it''s Celsius...<br/>Processing is spot on.</td>', 'Great dramatic lighting and composition, but 80? It''s a bit of an anti-climax. Mid-teens or 120 plus would be more appropriate, unless it''s Celsius...Processing is spot on.', '2008-11-15 22:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065857, 738101, 33552, '<td valign="top">Cool sculpture. The cloud, however, betrays a bit of the mystery in this shot. The vignette and the black border are nice on their own, but for this shot, togather, they are a bit too much, IMO.</td>', 'Cool sculpture. The cloud, however, betrays a bit of the mystery in this shot. The vignette and the black border are nice on their own, but for this shot, togather, they are a bit too much, IMO.', '2008-11-15 22:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065860, 737841, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern and color, but I''d prefer the focus to be a bit deeper into this shot, unless the rim is your intended focal point.</td>', 'Nice pattern and color, but I''d prefer the focus to be a bit deeper into this shot, unless the rim is your intended focal point.', '2008-11-15 22:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065863, 737572, 33552, '<td valign="top">Great concept, but I think you''re adding a bit too much light. Let the flame do it''s thing, and light the opposite side to keep the shape of the subject.</td>', 'Great concept, but I think you''re adding a bit too much light. Let the flame do it''s thing, and light the opposite side to keep the shape of the subject.', '2008-11-15 22:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065865, 737869, 33552, '<td valign="top">Classic, elegant and well executed. Good job.</td>', 'Classic, elegant and well executed. Good job.', '2008-11-15 22:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065869, 738224, 33552, '<td valign="top">The trouble with abstracts is that the eye struggles to find a recognizable object in the frame. It then locks onto that object, if found, and constantly refers to it to give context to the other forms. I''m afraid I''ve locked onto your thumb. Still, it''s a striking composition. I like the shape of the Mercury.</td>', 'The trouble with abstracts is that the eye struggles to find a recognizable object in the frame. It then locks onto that object, if found, and constantly refers to it to give context to the other forms. I''m afraid I''ve locked onto your thumb. Still, it''s a striking composition. I like the shape of the Mercury.', '2008-11-15 22:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065877, 737820, 33552, '<td valign="top">Were you going for a feature of the old carraige, or the contrast of old and new? Either way the concept would work, but theres a problem, the background. <br/>As it is, the subject is placed strongly in the center of the frame making the background seem incidental. To feature the carraige, try to remove as many distractions as possible. Try a low or high angle in this case. To contrast the carraige with the buildings, try to give them more or less equal weight in the image. In this case you could keep the carraige off to one side of the frame, for example.</td>', 'Were you going for a feature of the old carraige, or the contrast of old and new? Either way the concept would work, but theres a problem, the background. As it is, the subject is placed strongly in the center of the frame making the background seem incidental. To feature the carraige, try to remove as many distractions as possible. Try a low or high angle in this case. To contrast the carraige with the buildings, try to give them more or less equal weight in the image. In this case you could keep the carraige off to one side of the frame, for example.', '2008-11-15 22:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065882, 737892, 33552, '<td valign="top">Cheddar Sulfur? Sorry, couldn''t help it. Nice texture, but there''s something strange going on where the shadows and highlights meet.</td>', 'Cheddar Sulfur? Sorry, couldn''t help it. Nice texture, but there''s something strange going on where the shadows and highlights meet.', '2008-11-15 22:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065891, 737787, 33552, '<td valign="top">I must have suffered some deep psychological trauma as a child, because this photo scares the heck out of me! I''m honestly expecting some scary monster to jump out of the woods. Ok, let me try to figure out why... (you don''t mind if I think out loud, do you?)<br/>Alright, first the dark vignette plus black and orange border, plus blur vignette. That''s probably 90% of it right there. Next, the cognitive dissonance brought on by the ultra-innocent image of a child and, of all things, balloons, surrounded by the afore-mentioned threatening elements, <i>alone</i>, <b><i>in the woods</i></b>! Ok, it can''t just be me... can it?<br/>Deep breath...<br/>Technically, this shot is excellent. The creepy vignettes are well done, exposure, lighting, composition... all well done. Ever consider directing? Blair Witch has nothing on this photo!<br/>Oh yeah ... 10</td>', 'I must have suffered some deep psychological trauma as a child, because this photo scares the heck out of me! I''m honestly expecting some scary monster to jump out of the woods. Ok, let me try to figure out why... (you don''t mind if I think out loud, do you?)Alright, first the dark vignette plus black and orange border, plus blur vignette. That''s probably 90% of it right there. Next, the cognitive dissonance brought on by the ultra-innocent image of a child and, of all things, balloons, surrounded by the afore-mentioned threatening elements, alone, in the woods! Ok, it can''t just be me... can it?Deep breath...Technically, this shot is excellent. The creepy vignettes are well done, exposure, lighting, composition... all well done. Ever consider directing? Blair Witch has nothing on this photo!Oh yeah ... 10', '2008-11-15 22:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065892, 737775, 33552, '<td valign="top">Well shot, but try adding some context to make this photo stand out.</td>', 'Well shot, but try adding some context to make this photo stand out.', '2008-11-15 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065902, 738160, 90414, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, especially the oblique angle. The light from behind him detracts somewhat, and the title may be better said as contained by IRON, as "metal" really isn''t a specific element.</td>', 'I really like this shot, especially the oblique angle. The light from behind him detracts somewhat, and the title may be better said as contained by IRON, as "metal" really isn''t a specific element.', '2008-11-15 23:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065910, 737867, 90414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but isn''t H2O a compound? Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but isn''t H2O a compound? Well done.', '2008-11-15 23:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065914, 737921, 39880, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea for this.  Just a few things to fix, there seems to be quite a few dust spots, and get the powder a bit sharper.  I do like the blurred picture for the background.</td>', 'I really like the idea for this.  Just a few things to fix, there seems to be quite a few dust spots, and get the powder a bit sharper.  I do like the blurred picture for the background.', '2008-11-15 23:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065915, 737485, 33552, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shape and teture, but the background is making me cross-eyed.</td>', 'Fascinating shape and teture, but the background is making me cross-eyed.', '2008-11-15 23:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065916, 738238, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors.  It just looks a bit blurry.  I''d like to see her eyes sharper.</td>', 'I like the composition and colors.  It just looks a bit blurry.  I''d like to see her eyes sharper.', '2008-11-15 23:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065917, 737862, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I like it.  I just think it needs some softer lighting and needs to be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea, I like it.  I just think it needs some softer lighting and needs to be a bit sharper.', '2008-11-15 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065918, 737892, 39880, '<td valign="top">Looks like the color is a bit off, and it''s could use some sharpening.</td>', 'Looks like the color is a bit off, and it''s could use some sharpening.', '2008-11-15 23:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065919, 737598, 33552, '<td valign="top">Mystery cleavage has always frightened me. You can never <i>really</i> be sure what part of the body you are looking at. That said, this shot is well composed and well lit.</td>', 'Mystery cleavage has always frightened me. You can never really be sure what part of the body you are looking at. That said, this shot is well composed and well lit.', '2008-11-15 23:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065921, 737776, 39880, '<td valign="top">What element were you going for?  Good light and a nice sharp picture.</td>', 'What element were you going for?  Good light and a nice sharp picture.', '2008-11-15 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065925, 737375, 33552, '<td valign="top">Wow! It may be a real stretch for the challenge, but this is a fabulous shot! I''ll tell you this much, those giant wheels are a serious pain in the a to drive, but they are beautiful.</td>', 'Wow! It may be a real stretch for the challenge, but this is a fabulous shot! I''ll tell you this much, those giant wheels are a serious pain in the a to drive, but they are beautiful.', '2008-11-15 23:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065927, 738039, 33552, '<td valign="top">*shivers* Relevent. Excellent photograph.</td>', '*shivers* Relevent. Excellent photograph.', '2008-11-15 23:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065930, 737862, 33552, '<td valign="top">Is that a snowman... er... <i>salt</i>man? Cute!</td>', 'Is that a snowman... er... saltman? Cute!', '2008-11-15 23:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065932, 737913, 90414, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but to nitpick - I think pencil lead is graphite which is a carbon.... but those pencils look really sharp!</td>', 'I like the shot, but to nitpick - I think pencil lead is graphite which is a carbon.... but those pencils look really sharp!', '2008-11-15 23:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065934, 737824, 33552, '<td valign="top">You never know...<br/>Well shot, appropriate expression. I do hope she was well compensated ;)</td>', 'You never know...Well shot, appropriate expression. I do hope she was well compensated ;)', '2008-11-15 23:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065935, 737919, 90414, '<td valign="top">Clever entry with bonus points for humor.</td>', 'Clever entry with bonus points for humor.', '2008-11-15 23:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065937, 738147, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key approach, just watch your corners, they need a little dodging (esp. upper-right).</td>', 'I like the high-key approach, just watch your corners, they need a little dodging (esp. upper-right).', '2008-11-15 23:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065939, 737838, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, just watch out for haloing when you sharpen.</td>', 'Nice capture, just watch out for haloing when you sharpen.', '2008-11-15 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065940, 738223, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like the angled presentation. If you move it a bit off center, I think it will strengthen the compositon.</td>', 'I like the angled presentation. If you move it a bit off center, I think it will strengthen the compositon.', '2008-11-15 23:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065941, 737618, 90414, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and creative photo, but wasn''t this theory debunked... like 300 years ago?</td>', 'Very interesting and creative photo, but wasn''t this theory debunked... like 300 years ago?', '2008-11-15 23:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065942, 737829, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF. Try this shot from a few different angles for a stronger composition.</td>', 'Nice DoF. Try this shot from a few different angles for a stronger composition.', '2008-11-15 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065944, 738160, 33552, '<td valign="top">A referance to iron bars might have helped, but this is an excellent photograph. The lighting is dramatic and appears well planned.</td>', 'A referance to iron bars might have helped, but this is an excellent photograph. The lighting is dramatic and appears well planned.', '2008-11-15 23:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065948, 737830, 33552, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but without any sign of motion I see floating rather than falling. Try using flash on 2nd curtain sync with a slower shutter speed and a bit of ambient light to get a bit of trailing motion blur.</td>', 'I like the concept here, but without any sign of motion I see floating rather than falling. Try using flash on 2nd curtain sync with a slower shutter speed and a bit of ambient light to get a bit of trailing motion blur.', '2008-11-15 23:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065950, 737752, 33552, '<td valign="top">Point taken. I like the lighting here.</td>', 'Point taken. I like the lighting here.', '2008-11-15 23:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065952, 737843, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice concept here, but it seems a tad underexposed. Maybe it just needs a bit of ontrast.</td>', 'Nice concept here, but it seems a tad underexposed. Maybe it just needs a bit of ontrast.', '2008-11-15 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065953, 737849, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice light play. I''m not sure I like the frame divided right down the middle, but I like the overall concept and execution.</td>', 'Nice light play. I''m not sure I like the frame divided right down the middle, but I like the overall concept and execution.', '2008-11-15 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065955, 737941, 33552, '<td valign="top">Creepy. Why is it coming out of the mask? Anyway, good low key mood lighting.</td>', 'Creepy. Why is it coming out of the mask? Anyway, good low key mood lighting.', '2008-11-16 00:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065957, 737523, 33552, '<td valign="top">Your lighting really brings out the texture. Nice job!</td>', 'Your lighting really brings out the texture. Nice job!', '2008-11-16 00:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065958, 737925, 33552, '<td valign="top">Clever, nice concept. A bit over-sharpened.</td>', 'Clever, nice concept. A bit over-sharpened.', '2008-11-16 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5065961, 737587, 33552, '<td valign="top">Nice texture. The lighting works here.</td>', 'Nice texture. The lighting works here.', '2008-11-16 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1);
