(5068786, 737975, 54645, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of the challenge, I don''t think it will go over well due to the lack of an element, but I appreciate your thinking beyond the challenge description. Certainly nature is full of gold!!! <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, I feel the composition is lacking a focal point to support your intended subject in my opinion. I''m not crazy about the use of the reflective surface as it resulted in significant ghosting (at least I think  that''s what happened, I suppose it could be movement and it''s just blurry). <br/> <br/>I think it may have been interesting to have the flower facing the sun. Your "gold" would have been more prominent rather than in a harsh shadow. <br/> <br/>Sorry for the rough cc. 4 Ben<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-18 00:08:44.</i></td>', 'Interesting interpretation of the challenge, I don''t think it will go over well due to the lack of an element, but I appreciate your thinking beyond the challenge description. Certainly nature is full of gold!!!  Unfortunately, I feel the composition is lacking a focal point to support your intended subject in my opinion. I''m not crazy about the use of the reflective surface as it resulted in significant ghosting (at least I think  that''s what happened, I suppose it could be movement and it''s just blurry).  I think it may have been interesting to have the flower facing the sun. Your "gold" would have been more prominent rather than in a harsh shadow.  Sorry for the rough cc. 4 Ben', '2008-11-17 22:54:42.000000', '2008-11-18 00:08:44.000000', 1),
